      "source_text": "181. 画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的坐标平面上点的集合。а) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y>x,\\\\y<2x,\\\\y<4;\\end{array}\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}y-x<2,\\\\y+x>4,\\\\x-4<0;\\end{array}\\right.$ в) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y\\leqslant6,\\\\2x+2y\\geqslant7,\\\\x\\geqslant0;\\end{array}\\right.$г) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x-y\\geqslant3,\\\\x+y\\leqslant5,\\\\y\\geqslant1;\\end{array}\\right.$ д) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}|x|\\leqslant2,\\\\|y|\\leqslant3;\\end{array}\\right.$ е) $\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}|x|\\leqslant4,\\\\|y|\\geqslant5.\\end{array}\\right.$",
